          "markdownContent": "A **failure** is a check (`guard.dart`, `redirect.dart`), a content load (`data.dart`), an action (`action.dart`) or a code download that threw. An **uncaught error** is one nothing caught. Colours as on App health: 🟢 none · 🟠 a few · 🔴 many."
